GIMP Palette
Name: Volta 1-bit
Columns: 6
Channels: RGBA
# Wardenwatch hero parts (GDD section 7.2). Each swatch maps to one engine glyph; the import tool
# (tools/art/aseprite-import.ts) fails on any other colour. Index 0 is the sprite's transparent colour.
#
# Draw only with the six drawing swatches. The anchor swatches go on the hidden _anchors layer only,
# one pixel each.
  0   0   0   0	Transparent
  0   0   0 255	Black #
255 255 255 255	White w
128 128 128 255	Mid grey : (50% checker)
192 192 192 255	Light grey . (25% shade)
 64  96 192 255	Hatch blue = (horizontal hatch)
255   0   0 255	anchor.head
255 128   0 255	anchor.neck
  0 255   0 255	anchor.hand
  0   0 255 255	anchor.back
255   0 255 255	anchor.crown
  0 255 255 255	anchor.origin
